    "description": "Read and listen to the key insights of the finest books, podcasts and amazing short stories with Fabula.\r\n\r\nCurrently with more than 800,000 members worldwide, the audiobook app \u201cFabula\u201d (a.k.a. \u201cBiryudumkitap\u201d in Turkey), now available in English! Audiobook summaries and beautiful short stories you can read and/or tune into in a lickety-split 15 minutes, just a click away on your cell, wherever and whenever you want. Bite-sized key ideas from the bestselling books!\r\n\r\nCATCH UP WITH THE BOOKS YOU\u2019VE ALWAYS WONDERED ABOUT IN A 15-MIN. PODCAST FORMAT\r\n\r\n\u25cf Motivation, history, personal development, psychology, classics, and philosophy. Spot on nonfiction book summaries & reviews curated by academicians and professional editors.\r\n\u25cf New books, audio documentaries, and microbooks are added every day. \r\n\u25cf Read or listen to hundreds of audiobook reviews and stories.\r\n\u25cf Improve yourself in your business and academic life.\r\n\u25cf It is a learning app that helps your self growth & self improvement. Entrepreneur books, business books, self development books, and more.\r\n\u25cf Listen to audiobooks on the bus, train, car, plane, on the gym treadmill or on a walkabout around the neighborhood.\r\n\u25cf Discover a new way of microlearning with our original content: Audio documentaries, original stories, and more.\r\n\r\nREAD OR LISTEN\r\n\r\n\u25cf With the audiobook option, you can listen to books at the speed you want.\r\n\u25cf You can customize your library by adding the books you choose.\r\n\u25cf Check out our rapidly expanding archive of short stories for literature lovers.\r\n\u25cf With advanced reading options, you can adjust font size and brightness, with day or night modes to make for a comfy read.\r\n\r\nGET BOOK SUGGESTIONS AND DISCOVER NEW BOOKS\r\n\r\n\u25cf Check out a list specially prepared amongst hundreds of book summaries to begin listening immediately.\r\n\u25cf Discover new books with book recommendations prepared by our editors. It will help you develop a daily reading habit.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nMETICULOUSLY PREPARED BOOK SUMMARIES: FABULA\r\n\r\n\u25cf Read the book summaries prepared in plain language, selected for you from thousands of books and prepared by academics or editors.\r\n\u25cf Read and listen to classic stories from notable personalities such as Franz Kafka, Edgar Allan Poe, Jack London, Leo Tolstoy, and Anton Chekhov.\r\n\r\nDESIGNED FOR A BETTER READING EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\n\u25cf We present a methodology involving hundreds of books in 50 categories converted into book reviews and FABULA chapter format.\r\n\u25cf The book review, which starts with what we\u2019ll learn from the book, ends with the book\u2019s main message, plus some friendly recommendations.\r\n\u25cf Reading FABULA gives you just the highlights of these books. We always recommend you read books in their whole form.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nHOW DOES IT ALL WORK?\r\n\r\nDownload the FABULA app to kick off your free trial. If you want, go along with our monthly or annual plan paid membership.\r\n\r\nWith an available Premium Membership option, you\u2019ll have:\r\n\r\n\u25cf Unlimited access\r\n\u25cf The \u201cMy Library\u201d feature\r\n\u25cf The chance to read or listen to all the books on demand\r\n\r\nIf you don't need unlimited access, you can listen to the complimentary Book of the Day.\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.biryudumkitap.com/app/tos.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.biryudumkitap.com/app/privacy.html\r\n\r\nYou can reach the Fabula team for your questions, suggestions, critiques and copyright infringement notices via support@getfabula.com\r\n\r\nTo contact the Turkish Biryudumkitap team, please email us: editor@biryudumkitap.com",
